{
  "_说明": "复制为 kit.config.json 后按实际情况修改（install.py 会自动复制一份）。kit.config.json 是个人配置，不要提交、不要发给别人。路径里的反斜杠要写成两个 \\\\ 或者改用 /。",
  "python": "C:\\Program Files\\Python312\\python.exe",
  "default_profile": "quota",
  "profiles": {
    "quota": {
      "label": "额度充足（公司 bat，Copilot 1.0.75）",
      "launcher": "C:\\请改成你的\\copilot启动脚本.bat",
      "launcher_type": "bat",
      "token_mode": "full",
      "agent_flag": false,
      "launch_extra_args": [],
      "noninteractive_cmd": null,
      "_说明": "agent_flag：打开 bat 看最后一行调用 copilot 的地方，如果末尾有 %*（把参数传下去），就可以改成 true，挂件会直接带上 --agent；否则保持 false，挂件会提示你在会话里用 /agent 选择代理。"
    },
    "latest": {
      "label": "省 token（PATH 里的 copilot，1.0.105）",
      "launcher": "copilot",
      "launcher_type": "exe",
      "token_mode": "lean",
      "agent_flag": true,
      "launch_extra_args": [],
      "noninteractive_cmd": ["{launcher}", "--agent", "{agent}", "-p", "{prompt}"],
      "_说明": "noninteractive_cmd 只给 run_evals.py --agent 用（会消耗额度）。先运行 copilot --help 确认有 -p / --prompt 和 --agent 参数。"
    }
  },
  "projects": [
    {
      "name": "tap-ai-backend",
      "path": "C:\\Users\\234393\\Desktop\\tap-ai-backend",
      "style_pack": "style-tap-backend",
      "python_cmd": ["uv", "run", "python"],
      "checks": {
        "tests": ["uv", "run", "pytest", "tests/unit", "-q"],
        "lint": ["uv", "run", "ruff", "check", "src", "tests"],
        "types": ["uv", "run", "mypy", "src"],
        "collect": ["uv", "run", "pytest", "tests/unit", "--collect-only", "-q"]
      },
      "check_timeout": 900,
      "source_dirs": ["src"],
      "test_dirs": ["tests"],
      "protected": ["src/tap_ai/plugins/extensions/knowledge/**"],
      "protected_allow": ["src/tap_ai/plugins/extensions/knowledge/backends/kg_browse.py"],
      "isolated_import_modules": [
        "tap_ai.bootstrap",
        "tap_ai.persistence.models",
        "tap_ai.plugins.ingest.sdk_ingest"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "同事的问答知识插件 src/tap_ai/plugins/extensions/knowledge/ 不要改；唯一例外是 backends/kg_browse.py，且需要任务明确要求",
        "jp-poc 搜索索引只读：只用查询密钥，绝对禁止写入或删除",
        "共享 Neo4j：只允许写 jp-poc 范围；hk 的数据不删不改，写之前和写之后各数一次 hk 的数量",
        "本地 TAP_AI_LIBRARY_KB_GRAPH_ENABLED=false；本地不要调用 hk 文档的删除接口",
        "接口只用 GET 和 POST；配置直接用 settings.xxx；新功能开关默认关闭",
        "不要在 develop / master 上直接改，先建分支"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "fwd-tap-ingest",
      "path": "C:\\Users\\234393\\fwd-tap-common\\fwd-tap-ingest",
      "git_root": "C:\\Users\\234393\\fwd-tap-common",
      "style_pack": "",
      "python_cmd": ["uv", "run", "python"],
      "checks": {
        "tests": ["uv", "run", "pytest", "tests", "-q"],
        "lint": ["uv", "run", "ruff", "check", "src", "tests"],
        "collect": ["uv", "run", "pytest", "tests", "--collect-only", "-q"]
      },
      "check_timeout": 900,
      "source_dirs": ["src"],
      "test_dirs": ["tests"],
      "protected": [],
      "isolated_import_modules": ["tap_ingest_sdk.kg_schema"],
      "notes": [
        "src/tap_ingest_sdk/kg_schema.py 是叶子模块：不得导入本包里的其他模块（曾经因此循环导入）",
        "SDK 只在这个项目的虚拟环境里，后端的虚拟环境里没有它",
        "git 仓库根是 fwd-tap-common；提交时逐个文件 git add，绝对不要 git add ."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "guard": {
    "enabled": true,
    "extra_protected_files": [],
    "block_git_write": true,
    "block_shell_file_write": true,
    "block_package_install": true,
    "block_dangerous_delete": true,
    "block_ruff_format": true,
    "check_python_markers": true,
    "enforce_scope": true,
    "extra_deny_command_patterns": [
      "(?i)DETACH\\s+DELETE"
    ]
  },
  "memory": {
    "digest_max_chars": 1200,
    "digest_max_items": 8
  },
  "session_context": {
    "enabled": true,
    "max_chars": 1800
  }
}
